  "description": "The engine of OfficeAgent.NET, a translation layer between AI agents and OOXML: agents express intent as typed change plans, and the library turns them into valid Open XML manipulations. Provides the inspect → find → preview → commit flow, plan validation, atomic apply with anchor stabilization, document providers, and Open XML package services. Compose with a format module such as OfficeAgent.Word.",
